  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 42 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the clonazepam shortage on 2023-03-10 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection at Rubicon Research Limited (FEI 3008252295) ended 2023-01-27 and was classified VAI, 42 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The VAI classification letter for that inspection is dated 2023-03-14, 4 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A product label for clonazepam 1 mg tablets names Rubicon Research Limited as the registered plant (FEI 3008252295) with operations including manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 246 tablets of clonazepam 1 mg at 7.9 tablets per day, providing 31.3 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option by rule is to buy from Alembic Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
